    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Hand of the Dynasty",
    "summary": "Your **IMMORTALS** and **NECRON WARRIORS** units gain **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** on ranged attacks. Once you pick the unit for an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**, it keeps its eligibility to **[start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)**. Taking a **DYNASTY** unit in this **detachment** excludes it from another **detachment**.",
